vllm-rlt

The native Ouro model and configuration adapt the architecture published by
ByteDance in ByteDance/Ouro-1.4B, revision
574fa66cb8bf5abdc979642d01cf2b79b16bfab1, under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
https://huggingface.co/ByteDance/Ouro-1.4B

Upstream model/configuration sources include the following attribution:
Copyright 2024 The Qwen team, Alibaba Group and the HuggingFace Inc. team.
All rights reserved.

vllm-rlt modifies the execution structure, configuration handling, model loading,
and attention integration for standalone loop-level scheduling and depth-aware
paged KV caching. It does not include an upstream CDB runtime implementation.

The affine INT4 reference codec in vllm_rlt/kernels/kv_quantization/ adapts
FlashLoop's packing.py and cross-loop residual arithmetic in cache.py, revision
aeaadee10d75b7aa8c4a42a809f15c75d6d3bdc6, to vllm-rlt's logical KV tensor layout.
https://github.com/Superone77/FlashLoop

